TITLE:
Bifactor-CFA - 3 specific factors
DATA:
FILE = "Ch27-Data1.dat";
VARIABLE:
NAMES ARE X1 X2 X3 X4 Y1 Y2 Y3 Y4 Z1 Z2 Z3 Z4 GROUP;
USEVARIABLES ARE X1 X2 X3 X4 Y1 Y2 Y3 Y4 Z1 Z2 Z3 Z4;
ANALYSIS:
ESTIMATOR IS MLR;
MODEL:
G BY X1* X2 X3 X4 Y1 Y2 Y3 Y4 Z1 Z2 Z3 Z4;
F1 BY X1* X2 X3 X4;
F2 BY Y1* Y2 Y3 Y4;
F3 BY Z1* Z2 Z3 Z4;
G@1;
F1-F3@1;
G WITH F1@0 F2@0 F3@0;
F1 WITH F2@0 F3@0;
F2 WITH F3@0;
OUTPUT:
SAMPSTAT STANDARDIZED MODINDICES CINTERVAL RESIDUAL SVALUES TECH1 TECH3 TECH4;
